{"schema_version":1,"id":"01a181d9-de3b-7590-b9d6-c947f9f35d2c","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a181d8-3e87-7443-9e82-2e8d47650f48"},"sequence":20,"recorded_at":1793179901498992,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"01a181d9-de31-70b2-80c6-58ffe0a281a4","payload_type":"runtime.user_intent.accepted","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"bindings":[],"delivery_policy":"session_current","intent_id":"01a181d9-de31-70b2-80c6-58ffe0a281a4","model_messages":[{"content":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are Muse Code, the doer. Follow `.agents/skills/doe\nr/SKILL.md` and `AGENTS.md`.\n\n    Execute ONLY tickets/001-voice-loop-skeleton.md. Nothin\ng else.\n\n    Read in order:\n    1. AGENTS.md\n    2. SOULBOUND.md (state + §2 loop)\n    3. tickets/001-voice-loop-skeleton.md (binding intent,\nscope, non-goals)\n    4. docs/architecture.md REQ-40 and REQ-42 only\n\n    Rules:\n    - Authority: REQs > ticket > your judgment. Conflict =\nstop and report.\n    - Scope is Files in scope only. Non-goals are binding:\nno TTS, no memory graph, no on-chain, no Image, no deploy,\nplaceholder persona only.\n    - Ponytail ladder: reuse livekit-examples/agent-starter\n-react pattern first. Minimal new code.\n    - Muse VT is WebSocket-only with diarization. Spark is\nOpenAI SDK at https://api.meta.ai/v1, model muse-spark-1.3,\n key from MODEL_API_KEY. Never contributor tier.\n    - No secrets in code or commits. Document vars in .env.\nexample only.\n    - Organize agent/ as observe (VT WS) / orient (prefix +\n stranger fallback) / decide (Spark) / act (UI render + lat\nency log). No extra tools or deps.\n    - Write docs/built-vs-borrowed.md for every borrowed co\nmponent.\n\n    Verify yourself once:\n    pnpm install && pnpm build\n    node agent/scripts/latency-harness.ts --turns 20 --out\naudit/001-voice-loop-skeleton/verify.txt\n\n    Export your session log to audit/001-voice-loop-skeleto\nn/muse-session.log (secrets-scanned). Do NOT write review.m\nd. Do NOT commit. Do NOT push.\n\n    End with: files changed, which acceptance criteria pass\n, what you did not verify, any deviation.\n    AdaL reviews next. Push happens only after her PASS.\n\n  Then you run AdaL review, then push as one commit\n  referencing 001."}]}],"refill_blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":"[Pasted Content 1696 chars]"}],"semantic_kind":{"kind":"chat"},"source_session_id":"01a181d8-3e87-7443-9e82-2e8d47650f48","surface":"main","wake_policy":"start_once"}}
