d with a short report: what changed (files), which acceptance criteria you believe pass, what you did NOT verify, any deviations from the ticket and why.\\n\\n## Never do\\n\\n- `--yolo` / `--disable-approval` / `--disable-sandbox` on `programs/soulbound/`, `paywall/`, or anything touching keys, wallets, or signing.\\n- Broaden scope &quot;while you&apos;re in there.&quot;\\n- Fabricate a deploy, tx hash, address, or test output.\\n\\n</skill-body>\\n</read-skill-result>\",\"complete\":true},\"admission\":{\"PendingTool\":{\"result_id\":\"882c859e-2755-5732-a0e7-77aa000a7634\",\"index\":0,\"call_id\":\"call_01a181d9e7a9741e94b47c57774bc0d2\",\"recorded_sha256\":\"15b5a0694b240b1b0715c6292456d8efa9fa0520d7f42cc926caed00a64dcca1\"}}}"},"kind":"run","run_id":"01a181d9-de31-70b2-80c6-58ffe0a281a4","source_run_record_id":"ddb9c7a9-13b5-4730-b16e-471f9c7c01b6","source_run_record_sequence":29}}
